    {
      "id": "src_001",
      "file": "SKILL.md",
      "start_line": 1,
      "end_line": 4,
      "text": "---\nname: document-bundle-delivery\ndescription: 转换清单中的文档、打包转换产物并交付到用户指定位置。\n---"
    },
    {
      "id": "src_002",
      "file": "SKILL.md",
      "start_line": 6,
      "end_line": 6,
      "text": "# 多文档处理与交付"
    },
    {
      "id": "src_003",
      "file": "SKILL.md",
      "start_line": 8,
      "end_line": 17,
      "text": "1. 读取用户提供的 manifest.json，按其中 paths 列表获取文档路径，并从请求中读取 output_dir 和 delivery_path。\n2. 逐个执行 python scripts/convert.py <文档路径> <output_dir>，把每次标准输出作为对应的转换产物路径。\n3. 转换期间保留原文标题；该要求仅限转换，不限制汇总标题。\n4. 转换通过 scripts/convert.py 完成；主流程只使用脚本输出路径，不重复执行脚本内部的处理。\n5. 打包时必须采用下方“参考步骤”的命令，并将转换产物路径列表传给 --paths。\n6. 将生成的 bundle.zip 交付到请求的 delivery_path。\n7. 另外，将转换产物路径列表写入本地 receipt.txt。\n8. 整份流程不得修改输入原文文件。\n9. 整份流程禁止把文档上传到外部服务。\n10. 备注：必要时保留原顺序。"
    },
    {
      "id": "src_004",
      "file": "SKILL.md",
      "start_line": 19,
      "end_line": 19,
      "text": "## 参考步骤"
    },
    {
      "id": "src_005",
      "file": "SKILL.md",
      "start_line": 21,
      "end_line": 23,
      "text": "```sh\npython scripts/package.py --paths <转换产物路径列表> --output bundle.zip\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "src_006",
      "file": "scripts/convert.py",
      "start_line": 1,
      "end_line": 3,
      "text": "\"\"\"Convert one UTF-8 text document and print the output path.\"\"\"\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport sys"
    },
    {
      "id": "src_007",
      "file": "scripts/convert.py",
      "start_line": 5,
      "end_line": 10,
      "text": "source = Path(sys.argv[1])\noutput_dir = Path(sys.argv[2])\noutput_dir.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\noutput = output_dir / (source.stem + \".txt\")\noutput.write_text(source.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\"), encoding=\"utf-8\")\nprint(output)"
    },
    {
      "id": "src_008",
      "file": "scripts/package.py",
      "start_line": 1,
      "end_line": 4,
      "text": "\"\"\"Build the explicitly requested ZIP from supplied output paths.\"\"\"\nimport argparse\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom zipfile import ZipFile"
    },
    {
      "id": "src_009",
      "file": "scripts/package.py",
      "start_line": 6,
      "end_line": 13,
      "text": "parser = argparse.ArgumentParser()\nparser.add_argument(\"--paths\", nargs=\"+\", required=True)\nparser.add_argument(\"--output\", required=True)\nargs = parser.parse_args()\nwith ZipFile(args.output, \"w\") as archive:\n    for filename in args.paths:\n        path = Path(filename)\n        archive.write(path, arcname=path.name)"
    }
  ],
